{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisite: Deepling\n\nYou awaken to latent instincts you have from the cold, dark depths of the ocean, unlocking the hidden powers within you and enabling you to conjure inky clouds of mist and darkness. You gain the following benefits:\n\n- Your Constitution score increases by 1, to a maximum of 20.\n\n- You have resistance to cold damage.\n\n- You learn Fog Cloud and Darkness, each of which you can cast once without expending a spell slot or using other than somatic components. You regain the ability to cast those two spells in this way when you finish a long rest. When you cast one of these spells in this way, you can\u0027t be perceived by blindsight while you are in the area.\n\nThe spells\u0027 spellcasting ability is Constitution.","level":1}],"id":"Customee8b19a0-d539-4f17-ab57-0b08dc31a25f","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Dark of the Deep [EAB] [SM] [R]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}